rticle-title>Severe acute respiratory syndrome&#x02014;Taiwan, 2003.</article-title><source>MMWR Morb Mortal Wkly Rep</source>. <year>2003</year>;<volume>52</volume>:<fpage>461</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>4</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12807078</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R12"><label>12. </label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Cheung</surname><given-names>CY</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Poon</surname><given-names>LL</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Lau</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Luk</surname><given-names>W</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Lau</surname><given-names>YC</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Shortridge</surname><given-names>KF</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>Induction of postinflammatory cytokines in human macrophages by influenza A (H5N1) virus: a mechanism for the unusual severity of human disease?</article-title><source>Lancet</source>. <year>2002</year>;<volume>360</volume>:<fpage>1831</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(02)11772-7</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12480361</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R13"><label>13. </label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Hooton</surname><given-names>TM</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Haley</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Culver</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>White</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Morgan</surname><given-names>WM</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Carroll</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></string-name><article-title>The joint associations of multiple risk factors with the occurrence of nosocomial infection.</article-title><source>Am J Med</source>. <year>1981</year